---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Flat Signs & Printed Boards | Manchester Sign Group" description="Flat signs and printed board signage for business names, branding and promotions from Manchester Sign Group. Delivery throughout the United Kingdom.">
  <main class="inner-page">
    <div class="page-head"><small>STRAIGHTFORWARD BUSINESS SIGNAGE</small><h1>FLAT <em>SIGNS</em></h1><p>Clear, professional flat signage for business identification, displays, promotions and branded spaces.</p></div>
    <section class="content-card"><h2>Flat signs for business use</h2><p>Flat signs provide a simple, versatile surface for displaying a business name, logo, message or graphic. They can be considered for shopfronts, offices, internal displays and promotional use. Depending on the artwork and requirements, signage can also include printed board options.</p><p>We can discuss the suitable approach once we know the intended location, approximate size, artwork and how the sign will be mounted or displayed.</p></section>
    <section class="content-card"><h2>Printed board or cut vinyl board?</h2><p>Print on Board is suitable when the design uses full-colour images, gradients or detailed artwork. Cut Vinyl Board is an option for designs built around cut lettering, shapes or simpler graphics. The best choice depends on your artwork and the finish you want.</p><p>Send your design or describe the sign and we can discuss the available options for your project.</p></section>
    <section class="content-card"><h2>Request a quote</h2><p>Include the sign dimensions in centimetres, your artwork or wording, quantity if relevant, intended use and delivery destination. Manchester Sign Group is based in Manchester and offers delivery throughout the United Kingdom. All products include a one-year warranty.</p></section>
    <div class="page-actions"><a href="/quote/">GET A QUOTE →</a><a class="secondary" href="/services/">VIEW ALL SERVICES →</a></div>
    <nav class="related"><strong>Explore other sign types</strong><a href="/3d-signs/">3D signs</a><a href="/rgb-signs/">RGB 3D signs</a><a href="/neon-signs/">Neon signs</a></nav>
  </main>
</Layout>
<style>
.inner-page{width:min(900px,92%);margin:auto;padding:65px 0 85px}.page-head{max-width:760px;margin-bottom:28px}.page-head small{color:#ff1730;font-size:11px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:3px}.page-head h1{font-size:clamp(42px,8vw,72px);letter-spacing:-3px;line-height:1;margin:10px 0 14px}.page-head h1 em{font-style:normal;color:#ff1730}.page-head p,.content-card p,.content-card li{color:#aaa;line-height:1.75;font-size:15px}.content-card{padding:22px 24px;margin:14px 0;background:#0c0f11;border:1px solid #303437;border-radius:12px}.content-card h2{font-size:21px;margin:0 0 12px}.content-card p:last-child{margin-bottom:0}.content-card ul{padding-left:20px}.content-card li{padding:4px 0}.page-actions{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:22px}.page-actions a{padding:15px 18px;border-radius:8px;background:#ff1730;color:#fff;text-decoration:none;font-size:12px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.5px}.page-actions .secondary{background:transparent;border:1px solid #444}.related{display:flex;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;margin-top:28px;padding-top:22px;border-top:1px solid #303437}.related strong{width:100%;font-size:13px}.related a{color:#ff6677;font-size:13px}@media(max-width:600px){.inner-page{padding:45px 0 65px}.content-card{padding:18px}.content-card h2{font-size:19px}.page-head h1{font-size:46px}}
</style>